       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RDIOHANDLER.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
       SELECT F ASSIGN TO INPUTDD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD F.
       01 REC PIC X(8).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-PGM PIC X(8).
